/**
 * @mainpage Documentation - Automatic Dog Food Dispenser
 *
 * Welcome to the documentation for the ESP8266-based automatic dog food dispenser 
 * system with RFID identification.
 *
 * @section overview Overview
 *
 * This project implements an intelligent and automated pet feeding system with the following features:
 *
 * - **RFID Identification**: Automatic dog recognition via RFID collars
 * - **Motion Detection**: Infrared sensor to detect dog approach
 * - **Food Level Monitoring**: Ultrasonic sensor to monitor food stocks
 * - **Servo Motor**: Precise control of food dispensing
 * - **LCD Display**: Real-time user interface
 * - **Web Server**: REST API for remote monitoring and control
 * - **Event Logging**: Complete history with timestamps
 *
 * @section architecture Complete Class Hierarchy
 *
 * @dot
 * digraph class_hierarchy {
 *     rankdir = TB;
 *     node [shape=box, style=rounded];
 *     
 *     // Actuators hierarchy
 *     actuator [label="<<abstract>>\nActuator", style="rounded,filled", fillcolor="#FFE6CC"];
 *     digital_act [label="Digital Actuator"];
 *     i2c_act [label="I2C Actuator"];
 *     lcd [label="LCD Screen\n(I2C)"];
 *     servo [label="Servo Motor\n(Digital)"];
 *     
 *     actuator -> digital_act;
 *     actuator -> i2c_act;
 *     digital_act -> servo;
 *     i2c_act -> lcd;
 *     
 *     // Sensors hierarchy
 *     sensor [label="<<abstract>>\nSensor", style="rounded,filled", fillcolor="#FFE6CC"];
 *     digital_sens [label="Digital Sensor"];
 *     serial_sens [label="Serial Sensor"];
 *     ultrasonic [label="Ultrasonic Sensor\n(Distance)"];
 *     infrared [label="Infrared Sensor\n(Motion)"];
 *     rfid [label="RFID Sensor\n(Serial)"];
 *     
 *     sensor -> digital_sens;
 *     sensor -> serial_sens;
 *     digital_sens -> ultrasonic;
 *     digital_sens -> infrared;
 *     serial_sens -> rfid;
 *     
 *     // Dogs
 *     dog [label="Dog Class\n(Jop, Manouk)", style="rounded,filled", fillcolor="#CCFFCC"];
 *     
 *     // Logs
 *     logger [label="Logger\n(Event Logging)", style="rounded,filled", fillcolor="#CCCCFF"];
 *     
 *     // Dispenser (uses all components)
 *     dispenser [label="Dispenser\n(Main Logic)", style="rounded,filled", fillcolor="#FFCCFF"];
 *     
 *     // WiFi Server
 *     wifi [label="WiFi Server\n(REST API)", style="rounded,filled", fillcolor="#FFFFCC"];
 *     
 *     // Main system connections
 *     dispenser -> servo;
 *     dispenser -> lcd;
 *     dispenser -> ultrasonic;
 *     dispenser -> infrared;
 *     dispenser -> rfid;
 *     dispenser -> dog;
 *     dispenser -> logger;
 *     dispenser -> wifi;
 *     
 *     // Layout hints
 *     {rank = same; ultrasonic; infrared; rfid;}
 *     {rank = same; servo; lcd;}
 * }
 * @enddot
 *
 * @section modules Available Modules
 *
 * ### Actuators (dispenser_lib::actuators)
 * 
 * Control hardware output components:
 * - @ref dispenser_lib::actuators::actuator "Abstract base class"
 * - @ref dispenser_lib::actuators::digital_actuator "GPIO digital outputs"
 * - @ref dispenser_lib::actuators::i2c_actuator "I2C communication"
 * - @ref dispenser_lib::actuators::lcd_screen "RGB LCD screen over I2C"
 * - @ref dispenser_lib::actuators::servo_motor "Servo motor for dispensing"
 *
 * ### Sensors (dispenser_lib::sensors)
 * 
 * Read incoming sensor data:
 * - @ref dispenser_lib::sensors::sensor "Abstract base class"
 * - @ref dispenser_lib::sensors::digital_sensor "GPIO digital inputs"
 * - @ref dispenser_lib::sensors::serial_sensor "UART serial communication"
 * - @ref dispenser_lib::sensors::ultrasonic_sensor "Ultrasonic sensor (food distance)"
 * - @ref dispenser_lib::sensors::infrared_sensor "Infrared sensor (motion detection)"
 * - @ref dispenser_lib::sensors::rfid_sensor "RFID reader (dog identification)"
 *
 * ### Dog Management (dispenser_lib::dogs)
 * 
 * Dog profiles and feeding history:
 * - @ref dispenser_lib::dogs::dog "Dog profile with feeding history"
 *
 * ### Logging (dispenser_lib::logs)
 * 
 * Event logging with timestamps:
 * - @ref dispenser_lib::logs::logger "Events with NTP timestamps"
 *
 * ### Main Logic (dispenser_lib::dispenser)
 * 
 * System orchestration:
 * - @ref dispenser_lib::dispenser::handle_dog_detected "Auto detection and feeding"
 * - @ref dispenser_lib::dispenser::web_dispense "Manual feeding via web API"
 * - @ref dispenser_lib::dispenser::init_dispenser "Complete system initialization"
 *
 * ### Web Server (dispenser_lib::wifi_server)
 * 
 * REST API and synchronization:
 * - @ref dispenser_lib::wifi_server::init_wifi_server "Web server and WiFi setup"
 * - @ref dispenser_lib::wifi_server::init_time_ntp "NTP time synchronization"
 *
 * @section getting_started Quick Start
 *
 * ### Compilation and Flashing
 *
 * @code
 * # Install tools (first time)
 * make core
 *
 * # Compile and upload code
 * make run-all
 *
 * # Generate documentation
 * make docs
 * @endcode
 *
 * ### API Usage
 *
 * @code
 * // Read sensors
 * long distance_mm = ultrasonic_sensor.get_distance();
 * String rfid_tag = rfid_sensor.read_rfid(100);
 *
 * // Control servo
 * servo_motor->open();   // Open dispenser
 * delay(2000);
 * servo_motor->close();  // Close dispenser
 *
 * // Logging
 * app_log += "Important event";
 *
 * // LCD display
 * lcd_screen->display_message("Hello Dog!", 0, 0);
 * @endcode
 *
 * @section hardware Hardware Used
 *
 * | Component | Pin | Type |
 * |-----------|-----|------|
 * | Servo Motor | GPIO 15 | Digital Output |
 * | LCD RGB (I2C) | GPIO 4/5 (SDA/SCL) | I2C |
 * | Ultrasonic Sensor | GPIO 12 | Digital Input |
 * | Infrared Sensor | GPIO 13 | Digital Input |
 * | RFID Reader | GPIO 14 (RX) | UART Serial |
 *
 * @section features Features
 *
 * ✓ RFID identification of 2 dogs (Jop & Manouk)  
 * ✓ Configurable feeding interval (12h default)  
 * ✓ Food level detection (ultrasonic sensor)  
 * ✓ Complete event history with timestamps  
 * ✓ Web interface with REST API  
 * ✓ NTP time synchronization  
 * ✓ LCD real-time display  
 * ✓ LittleFS file system for data storage  
 *
